        "A": "High honeybee hive density may reduce wild bee diversity.",
        "B": "Honeybees are the only pollinators in Paris.",
        "C": "Urban beekeeping has no impact on wild bees.",
        "D": "The study focused on rural beekeeping."
      },
      "distractors": {
        "B": "The text does not claim honeybees are the only pollinators; it mentions wild bees.",
        "C": "The study suggests an impact, so this contradicts the text.",
        "D": "The study was in Paris, an urban area, not rural."
      }
    }
  ]
